# ERA Orchestrator — module map (web)

**Acceptance SSOT (Platform):** [Platform-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Platform-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Platform-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · [Implementation-Matrix](../../../docs/acceptance/Platform-Implementation-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/platform.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/platform.yaml)

## Public / auth

| Route | File | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| `/login` | `app/login/page.tsx` | AuthLoginCard; post-login 0/1/N routing (0 → onboarding gate, 1 → `/workspace`, N → `/organizations` picker on every login) |
| `/register` | `app/register/page.tsx` | User signup → `/organizations` |
| `/register-org` | `app/register-org/page.tsx` | Fallback org registration (modal preferred) |
| `/pricing` | `app/pricing/**` | Public storefront |
| `/help`, `/terms`, `/partner` | `app/help`, `app/terms`, `app/partner` | Public |
| `/portal/person-access` | `app/portal/person-access/page.tsx` | MDM Phase 2 citizen consent (guest QR session) |

## Post-login IA (workspace launcher)

Left-nav tree (`components/layout/orch-sidebar.tsx`): Workspace → Organization (organizations, holdings, team) → Workforce (employments, org-structure, positions, absences, security, export) → Resources (pricing, help) → Settings (settings, subscription) → Platform admin (super-admin only: nested Billing + MDM, Early access, Security).

| Route | File | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| `/` | `app/page.tsx` | Redirect only |
| `/organizations` | `app/organizations/page.tsx` | Org hub; `CreateOrganizationModal`; company-less onboarding gate auto-opens create modal; lists pending invites with Accept; link to `/holdings` |
| `/holdings` | `app/holdings/page.tsx` | Holding SoT: create, attach/detach orgs, report-access members; API `v1/holdings/*` |
| `/workspace` | `app/workspace/page.tsx` | Satellite cards: Open + per-satellite Modules modal + ⚙ Settings on active cards; concrete active-modules price; "+ Add" opens all-satellites modal; `POST connect-satellite`, `POST billing/toggle-module` |
| `/industry/[vertical]` | `app/industry/[vertical]/page.tsx` | SSO launch; not entitled → pricing link |
| `/settings` | `app/settings/page.tsx` | Settings hub |
| `/settings/team` | `app/settings/team/page.tsx` | Access requests |
| `/settings/subscription` | `app/settings/subscription/page.tsx` | Plan + module chips |
| `/super-admin/**` | `app/super-admin/**` | Platform admin |
| `/super-admin/orgs/[orgId]` | `app/super-admin/orgs/[orgId]/page.tsx` | Operating mode, departments, satellite endpoints, **Sync satellite bindings** → `POST /v1/admin/orgs/:id/sync-satellite-bindings` |

