## API (auth / subscription)

| Endpoint | Handler |
|----------|---------|
| `GET /memberships` | `membership.controller.ts` |
| `POST /auth/register-organization` | `auth.controller.ts` — provisions org-only trial |
| `POST /auth/switch-organization` | `membership.controller.ts` |
| `GET /v1/invites/pending` | `organization.controller.ts` — pending invites for current user email (company-less onboarding) |
| `POST /v1/invites/:id/accept` | `organization.controller.ts` — accept invite → create membership |
| `GET /v1/subscription/me` | `subscription.controller.ts` — satelliteEntitlements, connectableSatellites |
| `POST /v1/subscription/connect-satellite` | `subscription.controller.ts` — owner Connect |
| `POST /v1/billing/toggle-module` | `billing.controller.ts` — owner module enable/disable |
| `GET /v1/billing/module-states` | `billing.controller.ts` — pending deactivation flags |
| `GET /v1/admin/mdm/companies` | `admin-mdm.controller.ts` — legal entities (name decrypt + org fallback) |
| `GET /v1/admin/organizations/:id/subscription-tree` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |
| `PATCH /v1/admin/config/trial-allowlist` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |
| `POST /v1/admin/organizations/:id/connect-preset/sanatorium` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |

## Platform catalog gateway (API — industry satellites)

Auth: `Authorization: Bearer` (`SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN` or `CONTROL_PLANE_SERVICE_TOKEN`) + `X-Organization-Id`. Entitlement: `platform_reference_data` (skip locally: `REFERENCE_DATA_SKIP_ENTITLEMENT=1`). Proxies to data-hub `/registry/v1/*`.

| Endpoint | Handler |
|----------|---------|
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/day` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/days` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/is-working-day` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/add-business-days` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/fx/convert` | `catalog-fx.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/workforce/policy` | `workforce-policy.controller.ts` |
